---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
const site = 'https://ewohub.com';
const slug = 'chaturbate-analytics';
---
<Base
  title="Chaturbate Live-Analysen — Echtzeitdaten für Models & Studios"
  description="Kostenlose Live-Analysen für Chaturbate: beste Sendezeiten, Top-Tags, erfolgreiche Titel und Showpreise — täglich automatisch aktualisiert."
  lang="de"
  hreflang={[
    { lang: 'en', url: `${site}/${slug}` },
    { lang: 'de', url: `${site}/de/${slug}` },
    { lang: 'es', url: `${site}/es/${slug}` },
    { lang: 'ro', url: `${site}/ro/${slug}` },
    { lang: 'uk', url: `${site}/uk/${slug}` },
    { lang: 'ru', url: `${site}/ru/${slug}` },
  ]}
>

  <section class="art-hero">
    <div class="art-orb art-orb--1"></div>
    <div class="art-orb art-orb--2"></div>
    <div class="art-grid"></div>
    <div class="art-hero__inner container">
      <div class="art-meta">
        <span class="art-tag">Chaturbate</span>
        <span class="art-tag art-tag--green">Live-Daten</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="art-title">Live-<span class="art-grad">Analysen</span> für Chaturbate</h1>
      <p class="art-lead">Echtzeitdaten aus öffentlichen Chaturbate-Räumen — täglich aktualisiert. Nutze sie, um zur richtigen Zeit mit den richtigen Tags zu streamen.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="art-body">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="art-intro">Vier kostenlose Tools aus Live-Chaturbate-Daten. Kein Rätselraten — nur was heute tatsächlich funktioniert.</p>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="analytics-hub-grid">

          <a href="/de/best-hours-to-stream-chaturbate" class="analytics-hub-card">
            <div class="analytics-hub-card__icon">
              <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2" stroke="#e879a0" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M3 9h18" stroke="#e879a0" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M8 2v2M16 2v2" stroke="#e879a0" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M7 13l2 2 4-4" stroke="#22c55e" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="analytics-hub-card__body">
              <h2 class="analytics-hub-card__title">Beste Sendezeiten</h2>
              <p class="analytics-hub-card__desc">Sieh, welche Stunden die meisten Zuschauer pro Raum bringen — täglich mit Live-Daten aktualisiert.</p>
              <span class="analytics-hub-card__cta">Live-Diagramm ansehen →</span>
            </div>
          </a>

          <a href="/de/top-performing-tags-chaturbate" class="analytics-hub-card">
            <div class="analytics-hub-card__icon">
              <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M20.59 13.41l-7.17 7.17a2 2 0 01-2.83 0L2 12V2h10l8.59 8.59a2 2 0 010 2.82z" stroke="#e879a0" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="1.5" fill="#e879a0"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="analytics-hub-card__body">
              <h2 class="analytics-hub-card__title">Top-Tags heute</h2>
              <p class="analytics-hub-card__desc">Die Tags, die gerade von den meistgesehenen Räumen verwendet werden. Wähle die passenden aus und werde besser gefunden.</p>
              <span class="analytics-hub-card__cta">Live-Tags ansehen →</span>
            </div>
          </a>

          <a href="/de/top-performing-titles-chaturbate" class="analytics-hub-card">
            <div class="analytics-hub-card__icon">
              <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 6h16M4 10h10M4 14h12M4 18h8" stroke="#e879a0" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="analytics-hub-card__body">
              <h2 class="analytics-hub-card__title">Top-Titel heute</h2>
              <p class="analytics-hub-card__desc">Echte Raumtitel der erfolgreichsten Models von heute. Erkenne Muster und schreibe Titel, die mehr Zuschauer anziehen.</p>
              <span class="analytics-hub-card__cta">Live-Titel ansehen →</span>
            </div>
          </a>

          <a href="/de/chaturbate-show-prices" class="analytics-hub-card">
            <div class="analytics-hub-card__icon">
              <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="#e879a0" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M12 7v1m0 8v1m-3-5h6m-6 0a3 3 0 006 0" stroke="#e879a0" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="analytics-hub-card__body">
              <h2 class="analytics-hub-card__title">Aktuelle Showpreise</h2>
              <p class="analytics-hub-card__desc">Aktuelle Preisbenchmarks für Privatshows, Ziele und Trinkgeld-Menüs. Setze wettbewerbsfähige Preise basierend auf heutigen Daten.</p>
              <span class="analytics-hub-card__cta">Live-Preise ansehen →</span>
            </div>
          </a>

        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="art-cta section">
        <div class="art-cta__orb"></div>
        <div class="art-cta__inner">
          <span class="art-cta__badge">EWO Studio Team</span>
          <h2>Sollen wir diese Daten für dich anwenden?</h2>
          <p>Unser Team verfolgt diese Metriken täglich und nutzt sie, um Model-Accounts zu wachsen — wir kümmern uns um die Analyse, du konzentrierst dich aufs Streamen.</p>
          <div class="art-cta__actions">
            <a href="/de/studio-traffic" class="art-cta__btn--primary btn btn-primary">Studio-Services entdecken →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>

</Base>

<style>
.analytics-hub-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; }
.analytics-hub-card { display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: flex-start; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(232,121,160,0.15); border-radius: 16px; padding: 1.25rem; text-decoration: none; transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s; }
.analytics-hub-card:hover { border-color: rgba(232,121,160,0.35); background: rgba(232,121,160,0.05); }
.analytics-hub-card__icon { flex-shrink: 0; width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(232,121,160,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(232,121,160,0.18); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
.analytics-hub-card__body { flex: 1; }
.analytics-hub-card__title { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fce7f3; margin: 0 0 0.4rem; line-height: 1.3; }
.analytics-hub-card__desc { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #9b7389; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 0.75rem; }
.analytics-hub-card__cta { font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; color: #e879a0; }
</style>
